    {
      "title": "GECKORIENTALISM Main Story Update Announcement",
      "date": "2025-03-07 12:00:43",
      "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1793384379411261",
      "content": "After an intense and thrilling period of preparation, GECKORIENTALISM is finally advancing its main storyline! The new chapters will focus on the impact of the Lizardmen invasion on the inland regions\u2014rising new elites versus a crumbling old society, an influx of refugees clashing with the indifference of locals, cautious scheming against radical vengeance, and of course, the contrast between white-haired girls and nice body ladies\u2026\n\nThe new storyline will be available separately in the \"Early Access to New Storyline\" feature. Once this chapter's main story update is complete, it will be fully integrated into the game experience. Feel free to jump in and explore at any time!\n\nAdditional Content in Update 0.4.13:\nFixed entry and exit effects for character illustrations\nImproved the overall story viewing experience\nOptimized UI\nGet ready for an exciting new chapter!"
    },
