    },
    {
      "title": "0.4.9 Update Announcement",
      "date": "2024-11-13 02:30:12",
      "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1783238125171725",
      "content": "0.4.9 Update Announcement\nJust a week after the last update, the new episode's voiceover has been added, so it's really diligent~ After this update, our game will enter a relatively stable version, and new players and old players who have bought the game but haven't played it yet are welcome to experience it.\n\n0.5.0 Update Preview\nStarting from 0.5.0, we will be serialising updates to the main storyline, advancing the story to a new climax! Many players' concerns about the elf society and the lizardmen's conspiracy will be revealed, as well as the appearance of new characters! The first update is expected within this year, so stay tuned~!"
    },
